{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12202400","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12202400","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1220240001:1":{"text":"こ……これが……これが水なの？\nこんなに透き通っていて、臭いもまったくない……","source_cn":"这……这是……这是，水吗？\\n这么清澈，一点味道都没有……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x227919FDE98B93CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220240002:0":{"text":"すごいわ！この水はいくらですか？私に買えるかしら……？","source_cn":"这水太棒了！要多少钱呢？我的钱不够吧……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5A8E5F3EA675049","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220240003:1":{"text":"ハハハハ！心配しなくても金はかからん！海水をろ過したもんだからな！好きなだけ使うといい！","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈！放心吧，这水不贵！都是海水过滤的，要多少有多少！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x088537EB90449EB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220240004:1":{"text":"なにを遠慮してるんだ！さっさと使え！これからここの水は好きに使っていいぞ！","source_cn":"别磨蹭了，想用就用吧！以后这些水想怎么用就怎么用！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x681EEAF6238D424C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1220240005:0":{"text":"……ああ……本当に……本当にありがとうございます！ウウウッ……","source_cn":"……太、太、太感谢您了！太感谢您了！呜呜呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C3A1F7266D4D5D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","documen